    "overrides": "Pin the wagmi trio to the exact versions the root workspace build resolves (wagmi 3.5.0 / @wagmi/core 3.4.0 / @wagmi/connectors 7.2.1). A fresh standalone resolve floats @wagmi/core to 3.5.x, whose new `tempo` export imports optional deps (e.g. 'accounts') that break `next build`. npm ignores overrides in a workspace MEMBER, so this only affects the standalone Coolify/Nixpacks build, not the root build."
